# Stockpiling Celebrant (a 3/2): "When this creature enters, you may return another target nonland permanent you control to its
# owner's hand. If you do, scry 2." Turn 1 Bot1 casts the Celebrant with Plains and two Moxen: its legal targets are the Moxen
# only (the Plains is a land, the Celebrant itself is not "another"). Bot1 declines: the Moxen stay and nothing is scried
# (`! Bot1.Arrange`). Turn 3 Bot2's Ornithopter and the Plains are refused as targets for the second Celebrant, which returns
# Mox Pearl: it is in hand again and the scry 2 is answered (both to the top).

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Stockpiling Celebrant
Stockpiling Celebrant
Plains x4
Island
Island
Island x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Stockpiling Celebrant.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Target(Plains)
! Bot1.Target(Stockpiling Celebrant)
Bot1.Target(Mox Jet)
Bot1.Decline
! Bot1.Arrange
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Tapped = False
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Stockpiling Celebrant.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Target(Plains#1)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Mox Pearl)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Arrange(Island; Plains | )
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Colors.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 5
